<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dqlite on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/dqlite/</link><description>Recent content in Dqlite on Mi&amp;Bee Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>蓝宝石的傻话</managingEditor><lastBuildDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/tags/dqlite/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>「两台一起死」是个误传：双节点集群的正确姿势</title><link>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/incus/incus-two-node-cluster-quorum/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 09:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.mickeyzzc.tech/posts/incus/incus-two-node-cluster-quorum/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;决定组集群之前，我听到的最大警告是：「两节点集群没有容错，挂一台就全挂，两台一起死。」这句话对了一半——而错的那一半，恰恰决定了整个架构方案。这篇把 Raft 多数派的账算清楚，并给出把「1 主 + N 副」固化下来的两条路。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>